<title>POLAND: Polish shares end higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish shares rose in 16.7-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday, with the WIG 20 index rising 2.2 percent to 1,779.8 points, as 11 stocks rose, three fell and seven stayed flat.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 0.3 percent in 20.7-million-zloty trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
